<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 81,481.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 81,481.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of December 31 totaled 81,481 bales, up from 80,473 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,014 bales issued, no decertification orders, six cancellations, and 5,651 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
